  "details": "I'm experiencing quite frequent VRC-crashes when trying to take photos (8k) using the ingame camera.\n\nThis started happening a couple of updates ago, did notice it for the first time ~2 weeks ago. \n\nSince then I used the ingame camera mayhaps 7x - and VRC crashed back to desktop after taking 'a couple' pix in 4 out of those 7 attempts.\n\nNo error to speak of -  it just dies in silence, except for a win eventlog entry (attached, sorry for german but I think it should be pretty selfexplanatory).\n\nUp until 3 weeks ago I could take \"near endless\" picture-series (one shot every 2 seconds triggered via OSC-script) and VRC didnt care - even after a couple hundred pics it kept working perfectly fine... 🤔\n\nApart from that my VRC-client didnt crash a single time these last weeks - only when trying to take pictures.",
